{title: Mujhe Tum Nazar Se}
{artist: Mehdi Hassan}
{key: A}

{c: Verse 1}
[A] Mujhe tum nazar se gira to [D] rahe ho,        Mujhe tum [E] kabhi bhi bhula na [A] sakoge
[A] Mujhe tum nazar se gira to [D] rahe ho,        Mujhe tum [E] kabhi bhi bhula na [A] sakoge
[A] Na jaane Mujhe Kyun yaqeen ho [D] chala hai,        Mere pyar [E] ko tum mita na [A] sakoge
[A] Mujhe tum nazar se...        [A] Meri yaad hogi, jidhar jao [D] ge tum
Kabhi naghma [G] banke [E] kabhi banke [A] aansu
Kabhi naghma [G] banke [E] kabhi banke [A] aansu
Tadapta [D] Mujhe har [E] taraf pao [A] ge tum,        [A] Shama jo jalai hai meri [D] wafa ne
Bujhana bhi [E] chaho, bujha na [A] sakoge,        [A] Mujhe tum nazar se...
[A] Kabhi naam baaton mein aaya [D] jo mera,        To bechain [G] ho ho ke [E] dil tham [A] loge
To bechain [G] ho ho ke [E] dil tham [A] loge,        Nigaho me [D] chayega [E] ghum ka [A] andhera
[A] Kisi ne jo poocha sabab aan [D] suon ka,        Batana bhi [E] chaho, bataa na [A] sakoge
[A] Mujhe tum nazar se gira to [D] rahe ho,        Mujhe tum [E] kabhi bhi bhula na [A] sakoge
